  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Take any big pile of real numbers.",
      "emph": [
        "real"
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 72
    },
    {
      "text": "Populations. Invoices. River lengths.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 72,
      "durationInFrames": 78
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine possible first digits.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 156,
      "durationInFrames": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "Each should turn up about",
      "emph": [
        "should"
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 199,
      "durationInFrames": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "eleven percent of the time.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 238,
      "durationInFrames": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't.",
      "emph": [
        "doesn't."
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 285,
      "durationInFrames": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "One turns up thirty percent",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 306,
      "durationInFrames": 50
    },
    {
      "text": "of the time.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 356,
      "durationInFrames": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine comes up under five.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 379,
      "durationInFrames": 47
    },
    {
      "text": "The reason isn't statistics. It's spacing.",
      "emph": [
        "spacing."
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 436,
      "durationInFrames": 73
    },
    {
      "text": "Real quantities grow by multiplying.",
      "emph": [
        "multiplying."
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 526,
      "durationInFrames": 66
    },
    {
      "text": "So build a ruler the way",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 592,
      "durationInFrames": 46
    },
    {
      "text": "multiplying works:",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 638,
      "durationInFrames": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "one to two is the same move",
      "emph": [
        "same"
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 672,
      "durationInFrames": 50
    },
    {
      "text": "as ten to twenty.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 722,
      "durationInFrames": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "On that ruler the stretch labelled",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 760,
      "durationInFrames": 58
    },
    {
      "text": "one is six times wider than",
      "emph": [
        "six",
        "times",
        "wider"
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 818,
      "durationInFrames": 46
    },
    {
      "text": "the one labelled nine.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 864,
      "durationInFrames": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop a number anywhere;",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 902,
      "durationInFrames": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "it lands on one far more often.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 942,
      "durationInFrames": 53
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the whole law.",
      "emph": [
        "whole"
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1001,
      "durationInFrames": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's why auditors run it",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1033,
      "durationInFrames": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "across company books.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1075,
      "durationInFrames": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Invent figures by hand and",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1112,
      "durationInFrames": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "your digits come out too even.",
      "emph": [
        "too",
        "even."
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1151,
      "durationInFrames": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Even is what people reach for",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1195,
      "durationInFrames": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "when they want to look random.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1238,
      "durationInFrames": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "Greece reported a",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1289,
      "durationInFrames": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "three point seven percent deficit.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1324,
      "durationInFrames": 52
    },
    {
      "text": "It was fifteen.",
      "emph": [
        "fifteen."
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1376,
      "durationInFrames": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "But the ruler only reads numbers",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1415,
      "durationInFrames": 53
    },
    {
      "text": "that span orders of magnitude.",
      "emph": [
        "span"
      ],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1468,
      "durationInFrames": 49
    },
    {
      "text": "Heights don't.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1517,
      "durationInFrames": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Votes in one precinct don't.",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1541,
      "durationInFrames": 47
    },
    {
      "text": "Point it at those and it isn't",
      "emph": [],
      "emphColor": "accent",
      "fromFrame": 1588,
      "durationInFrames": 50
    },
    {
      "text": "saying anything.",
      "emph": [
        "anything."
      ],
      "emphColor": "magenta",
      "fromFrame": 1638,
      "durationInFrames": 27
    }
  ]
}